    description: "Repro: f and g each define a local `inner` calling helper -> edges credited to the first inner; inner -> helper replaces f -> helper. Related family: WI-tosum (enclosing lookup by name).\n\nFound by the 2026-10-10 docstring-staleness audit (reviewer + default-REJECT verifier, reproduced). Notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10102026.md."  # 487c
